{"ts":1777820172055,"state_hash":"387737bd96c9ff09","passage":"QuestsPage","engine":"sugarcube","body_text":"What's Next\nStory Goals\nRent's due Sunday morning. If I don't have it, I'm out on the street.\nUgh, I really need a shower.\nI'm wiped. I need to rest before I can think straight.\nFrank\nFrank's offering bookkeeping work — cash in hand. Rent's hanging over me. I can't afford to skip a session.\n🎯 To advance:\n◯ Frank trust ≥ 15 0 / 15\n◯ Bookkeeping ≥ 3 0 / 3\nRyan\nRyan's out in the yard most days. Maybe I should help him.\n🎯 To advance:\n◯ Ryan trust ≥ 10 5 / 10\n◯ Settled in at Frank's\nJake\nJake stays in his room. Maybe if I look right, he'll notice me.\n🎯 Two paths to advance:\nPath A:\n◯ Beauty ≥ 50 40 / 50\nPath B:\n◯ Jake noticed me\n\n← Back","body_html":"<h2>What's Next</h2>        <div class=\"npc-section\">     <h3 class=\"npc-name\">Story Goals</h3>                <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Rent's due Sunday morning. If I don't have it, I'm out on the street.</div>   </div>             <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Ugh, I really need a shower.</div>   </div>             <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">I'm wiped. I need to rest before I can think straight.</div>   </div>     </div>                           <div class=\"npc-section\">         <h3 class=\"npc-name\">Frank</h3>                                  <div class=\"stage-hint-card\">     <div class=\"stage-hint-flavor\">Frank's offering bookkeeping work — cash in hand. Rent's hanging over me. I can't afford to skip a session.</div>     <div class=\"stage-hint-goal\"><div class=\"stage-hint-goal-header\"><span class=\"stage-hint-target\">🎯</span> To advance:</div><ul><li class=\"stage-hint-unmet-row\"><span class=\"stage-hint-unmet\">◯</span> Frank trust ≥ 15 <span class=\"stage-hint-progress\">0 / 15</span></li><li class=\"stage-hint-unmet-row\"><span class=\"stage-hint-u